# Neither kick of amplitude 1 fires alone. The first one bleaches the absorber a little, and the carriers remember it for about a carrier lifetime (100): a second kick within that time fires the pillar.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Two sub-threshold kicks 5 photon lifetimes apart
sites 1
kick 1 amplitude=1
kick 1 time=5 amplitude=1
run 700
expect total 1
expect last 24.81171 0.003
expect count 1 1
expect arrival 1 24.81171 0.003
expect peak 1 57.079525 2e-4
expect fired 1 yes
